description:
Allows us to tell which daemons are online at any given time.

Useful when launches are lengthy and unpredictable e.g. queued on a cluster system or in cloud infrastructure.

@wlandau.

@jcheng5 as we discussed.

There's always been a mention of you in the readme: https://shikokuchuo.net/mirai/#thanks but this makes it more 'official'.

Thanks again for the contributions, not just for event-driven promises but also the tight integration within Shiny.
